{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mech Fortress</strong> offers a vast array of maps to choose from, with each map featuring enemies that have distinct corresponding traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely arrange turrets on a 5\u00d75 grid and unlock more turrets through battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/4190dcccaa78bdcc6e977f87bf6134b6.poster.avif?t=1772704703\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/4190dcccaa78bdcc6e977f87bf6134b6.webm?t=1772704703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/4190dcccaa78bdcc6e977f87bf6134b6.mp4?t=1772704703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turret placement is set before combat begins. The game includes an auto-upgrade feature, allowing for full idle gameplay with proper planning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also choose to upgrade manually for even higher potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight while traveling between different worlds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Space Station - C2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/47e1fb346c7ef57c577a6521d06af952.poster.avif?t=1772704703\" width=500 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/47e1fb346c7ef57c577a6521d06af952.webm?t=1772704703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900620/extras/47e1fb346c7ef57c577a6521d06af9